v 3
d gemini: use Google's Gemini AI from the Stata command line via the Gemini CLI
d
d gemini wraps the official Google Gemini CLI so that a prompt can be sent, and
d its answer read back, without leaving Stata.  Use it to run live web searches
d for data and facts, generate synthetic datasets for testing, get help with
d Stata syntax and coding logic, and pull structured output (csv or json)
d straight into memory with the clear option.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer, Node.js, and the Gemini CLI
d (npm install -g @google/gemini-cli) authenticated against a Google account.
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261109
d
f gemini.ado
